{"lines":[{"x":0.29847224564308,"w":0.3767519368753805,"y":0.8608957233590796,"h":0.027790031735859255,"text":"Lamentations 3: 22-41","conf":1},{"text":"June 23, 1946","y":0.81456281202218472,"conf":1,"w":0.21191383956314686,"x":0.38216659606689923,"h":0.02639763222800362},{"w":0.78384795746245939,"text":"The steadfast love of the Lord never ceases, his mercies never","y":0.77752976165726861,"h":0.020435354066273503,"x":0.1092636731452549,"conf":1},{"x":0.078384805675921765,"text":"come to an end; they are new every morning; great is thy faith-","conf":1,"y":0.75719246026112197,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.020423818202245814},{"conf":1,"x":0.075746016235631417,"w":0.81761075304700193,"h":0.027566438629513579,"text":"fulness. \"The Lord is my portion,\" says my soul, \"therefore I","y":0.73570572506137943},{"y":0.72093023307206372,"text":"will hope in him.\"","x":0.078384792558550243,"w":0.24228029127244827,"conf":1,"h":0.017441859320988851},{"h":0.022414478044661346,"text":"The Lord is good to those who wait for him, to the soul that","conf":1,"x":0.11152576863466028,"y":0.6971480563193424,"w":0.78167749380136464},{"h":0.020377676638345887,"text":"seeks him. It is good that one should wait quietly for the salva-","y":0.6787790698651206,"x":0.078384803181860113,"w":0.81472684191418931,"conf":1},{"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"tion of the Lord. It is good for a man that he bear the yoke in","x":0.078384807754306521,"h":0.020423818202245814,"y":0.6598837212822718,"conf":1},{"text":"his youth.","x":0.078313063177881351,"y":0.64080189704036505,"w":0.13078480262260933,"h":0.019268298905993131,"conf":1},{"x":0.11142741140041212,"w":0.7819117756633015,"conf":1,"y":0.62029574652097907,"h":0.023484298161097872,"text":"Let him sit alone in silence when he has laid it on him; let"},{"y":0.60019841304278421,"conf":1,"x":0.078384807754306521,"h":0.020441121525234696,"text":"him put his mouth in the dust—there may yet be hope; let him","w":0.81472684191418931},{"conf":1,"y":0.57986111071506707,"x":0.078384827952333855,"w":0.70308784385780243,"h":0.020429586607312311,"text":"give his cheek to the smiter, and be filled with insults."},{"h":0.020418050743284732,"conf":1,"text":"For the Lord will not cast off for ever, but, though he cause","x":0.11163896210773668,"y":0.55952380944246682,"w":0.78147268914557122},{"text":"grief, he will have compassion according to the abundance of","conf":1,"y":0.54067460305916226,"h":0.018918419641161588,"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.078384806031390336},{"h":0.01889534791310632,"y":0.5218023261040089,"x":0.078384804359611454,"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"his steadfast love; for he does not willingly afflict or grieve the","conf":1},{"text":"sons of men.","conf":1,"x":0.080306276276099764,"w":0.16258207544103845,"y":0.50413144831388701,"h":0.016512622908940289},{"h":0.020348837451329427,"conf":1,"y":0.47965116288837639,"text":"To crush under foot all the prisoners of the earth, to turn","x":0.11163896993836747,"w":0.77909737128716028},{"y":0.4622093029148131,"w":0.71021374789151281,"h":0.018941490423111662,"x":0.078384821392723181,"conf":1,"text":"aside the right of a man in the presence of the Most"},{"text":"High, to","conf":1,"x":0.78347769636634745,"y":0.45998896958581403,"w":0.11000422688273637,"h":0.021882527404361252},{"text":"subvert a man in his cause, the Lord does not approve.","w":0.72209023810052253,"y":0.44186046572267879,"conf":1,"x":0.076009508740712731,"h":0.020441121525234696},{"y":0.42151162851337654,"h":0.020452657389262274,"w":0.77909737128716028,"x":0.11163896198112302,"text":"Who has commanded and it came to pass, unless the Lord","conf":1},{"y":0.40222233200982938,"x":0.078224044341594509,"w":0.81504777189973121,"h":0.02254095153203084,"conf":1,"text":"has ordained it? Is it not from the mouth of the Most High that"},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"x":0.078384818756195032,"y":0.38070436471382307,"text":"good and evil come? Why should a living man complain, a man,","conf":1,"h":0.021911914386446574},{"w":0.43705462170885756,"h":0.02041228328432354,"conf":1,"text":"about the punishment of his sins?","y":0.36185515847846283,"x":0.078384807257210087},{"h":0.020400747420295851,"text":"Let us test and examine our ways, and return to the Lord!","conf":1,"y":0.3415178566753394,"x":0.11163895321818837,"w":0.78147268914557122},{"conf":1,"text":"Let us lift up our hearts and hands to God in heaven.","y":0.32266865069797335,"w":0.70308789339932531,"x":0.07838480025203956,"h":0.018901116318172928},{"conf":1,"y":0.28770061852688966,"h":0.023699978041270442,"text":"\"The steadfast love of the Lord never ceases,","x":0.18492326088629599,"w":0.61593652700448964},{"conf":1,"x":0.20427554615793669,"y":0.26736111158223119,"w":0.4703087744774756,"h":0.01909722222222221,"text":"his mercies never come to an end;"},{"conf":1,"w":0.39667456490652908,"h":0.020412282338218124,"y":0.24273255874593458,"x":0.20427554774269741,"text":"they are new every morning,"},{"conf":1,"y":0.21939221935790054,"w":0.3426518130612064,"h":0.021999731896415575,"x":0.20398231384072094,"text":"great is thy faithfulness.\""},{"y":0.18895348870496298,"x":0.078384807754306521,"conf":1,"text":"WHAT a sublime faith expresses itself in these words! Do we","h":0.021860003471374512,"w":0.81472684191418931},{"text":"not shrink from repeating them? Do we begin each day with","h":0.022978049422067381,"y":0.16609222667225809,"x":0.075885403731505943,"w":0.81261939507026171,"conf":1},{"y":0.14384920647579236,"conf":1,"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"an expression of thanksgiving that the mercy and faithfulness","h":0.021848467607346822,"x":0.076009494838629801},{"x":0.076009506477584657,"text":"of God have once more irradiated our lives? Or do the","y":0.1249999996882506,"conf":1,"h":0.017441860267094267,"w":0.81472684191418931},{"w":0.81472684191418943,"conf":1,"y":0.098837209563521711,"h":0.020458425794328994,"text":"clouds of bitter anxiety and grief dull our horizon every","x":0.076009495566064539},{"x":0.45130641327262261,"conf":1,"text":"223","w":0.057007126993947221,"h":0.015988372621082103,"y":0.07412790655283108}],"page":219,"w":7029,"h":11508}